Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,{=2}===============================DIALOGUE============================
Dialogue: 50,0:00:02.96,0:00:05.80,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Let's show them\Nwhat we've got, Kaido.
Dialogue: 50,0:00:07.34,0:00:11.31,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The whole shebang.\NWe'll see how many survive.
Dialogue: 50,0:00:15.81,0:00:18.77,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Trafalgar! Use your power!
Dialogue: 50,0:00:18.77,0:00:21.32,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Why aren't you teleporting\Nthem downstairs?
Dialogue: 50,0:00:21.32,0:00:23.94,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,If I could, I would've\Ndone it already.
Dialogue: 50,0:00:23.94,0:00:25.74,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Their Haki is too strong.
Dialogue: 50,0:00:25.74,0:00:28.61,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I can't get these two\Noutta here!
Dialogue: 50,0:00:28.61,0:00:32.28,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,In that case,\Nwe'll do it by force!
Dialogue: 50,0:00:36.54,0:00:40.08,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Dammit! Here comes a big one!
Dialogue: 50,0:01:10.12,0:01:14.21,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'll stretch that skin\Noff your skull, old man!
Dialogue: 50,0:02:28.98,0:02:32.61,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I can hear their voices,\Nthey're around here somewhere.
Dialogue: 50,0:02:32.61,0:02:34.32,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I guess they got away.
Dialogue: 50,0:02:34.32,0:02:36.45,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,They're better than I thought!
Dialogue: 50,0:02:38.12,0:02:40.91,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey, Zoro, you still alive?
Dialogue: 50,0:02:43.62,0:02:45.01,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I think so.
Dialogue: 50,0:02:45.01,0:02:45.08,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Nice job blocking that,\Neven for a sec. You saved us.
Dialogue: 50,0:02:45.08,0:02:47.75,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Nice job blocking that,\Neven for a sec.
Dialogue: 50,0:02:47.75,0:02:49.64,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You saved us.
Dialogue: 50,0:02:49.64,0:02:49.71,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Where's Straw Hat?
Dialogue: 50,0:02:49.71,0:02:51.17,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Where's Straw Hat?
Dialogue: 50,0:03:14.36,0:03:14.63,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey, Kaido, you\Nmoved. Was it gonna hurt?
Dialogue: 50,0:03:14.63,0:03:17.38,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey Kaido, you moved.
Dialogue: 50,0:03:17.38,0:03:19.55,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Was it gonna hurt?
Dialogue: 50,0:05:17.83,0:05:21.30,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Burn! That's it!\NBurn it all to the ground!
Dialogue: 50,0:05:21.30,0:05:23.51,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Leave nothing but ash!
Dialogue: 50,0:05:25.18,0:05:27.14,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It won't stop spreading!
Dialogue: 50,0:05:27.14,0:05:29.93,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Damn it!\NWe have enough problems already!
Dialogue: 50,0:05:29.93,0:05:32.56,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Fukurokuju,\NI require your expertise.
Dialogue: 50,0:05:32.60,0:05:35.23,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,They must have a stockpile\Nof explosives here, right?
Dialogue: 50,0:05:35.23,0:05:37.60,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yes.\NI shall take you to them.
Dialogue: 50,0:05:40.20,0:05:42.53,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The castle will burn\Nto the ground at this rate.
Dialogue: 50,0:05:44.30,0:05:46.01,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Screw you, Kaido!
Dialogue: 50,0:05:46.01,0:05:48.51,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,And screw your New Onigashima\NProject, too, damn it!
Dialogue: 50,0:05:48.51,0:05:49.93,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Orochi!
Dialogue: 50,0:05:49.93,0:05:52.22,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,So this is your doing, is it?
Dialogue: 50,0:05:52.22,0:05:54.81,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Look who crawled out\Nof their graves again!
Dialogue: 50,0:05:54.81,0:05:57.44,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I suppose you ghosts are\Nsurprised to see me.
Dialogue: 50,0:05:58.25,0:06:00.58,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What exactly is your goal here?
Dialogue: 50,0:06:00.58,0:06:02.00,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's been 20 years
Dialogue: 50,0:06:02.00,0:06:04.30,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,and you still won't drop\Nthis blasted crusade!
Dialogue: 50,0:06:04.30,0:06:06.80,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You hunted me down\Nall the way here?
Dialogue: 50,0:06:06.80,0:06:10.64,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Has your hate for me really\Nfueled you all this time?
Dialogue: 50,0:06:10.89,0:06:13.35,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Lord Orochi,\Nit may be worth noting
Dialogue: 50,0:06:13.35,0:06:15.48,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,that they didn't witness\Nyour execution.
Dialogue: 50,0:06:15.48,0:06:18.07,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Better to run. I'll handle them.
Dialogue: 50,0:06:18.07,0:06:20.32,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Shut your mouth! How dare you!
Dialogue: 50,0:06:21.53,0:06:23.95,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It looks like you took\Nquite a beating!
Dialogue: 50,0:06:23.95,0:06:25.74,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Is that why you've come to me?
Dialogue: 50,0:06:25.74,0:06:26.95,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You're all half dead
Dialogue: 50,0:06:26.95,0:06:28.74,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,and you want me to\Nfinish the job for you,
Dialogue: 50,0:06:28.74,0:06:30.83,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,or did somebody hit\Nyour heads too hard
Dialogue: 50,0:06:30.83,0:06:32.75,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,and now you've lost your minds?
Dialogue: 50,0:06:32.75,0:06:34.46,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Now step aside, Orochi.
Dialogue: 50,0:06:34.50,0:06:37.00,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We won't allow you to\Nwaste more of our time.
Dialogue: 50,0:06:37.00,0:06:39.13,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,And what happens if I say no?
Dialogue: 50,0:06:39.13,0:06:40.42,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 50,0:07:26.86,0:07:29.40,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Do you really think\Nyou're the heroes here?
Dialogue: 50,0:07:29.40,0:07:32.28,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Citizens are supposed to\Nbow before their Shogun,
Dialogue: 50,0:07:32.28,0:07:33.82,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,not disrupt the peace!
Dialogue: 50,0:07:33.82,0:07:36.45,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Don't you know the\Nmeaning of "authority"?
Dialogue: 50,0:08:25.92,0:08:26.06,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Lord Orochi!
Dialogue: 50,0:08:26.06,0:08:28.00,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Lord Orochi!
Dialogue: 50,0:08:28.00,0:08:28.07,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'll let them decide\Nyour punishment in hell.
Dialogue: 50,0:08:28.07,0:08:30.90,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'll let them decide\Nyour punishment in hell.
Dialogue: 50,0:08:30.90,0:08:32.45,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Onward!
Dialogue: 50,0:08:34.82,0:08:37.58,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Are you going\Nto avenge your lord?
Dialogue: 50,0:08:37.58,0:08:39.83,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Seems you have some\Nintegrity, after all.
Dialogue: 50,0:08:39.83,0:08:41.41,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Even though he was a fool,
Dialogue: 50,0:08:41.41,0:08:43.79,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,you stayed loyal\Nto him till the end.
Dialogue: 50,0:08:43.79,0:08:46.67,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ironic, hearing that\Nfrom you of all people.
Dialogue: 50,0:08:46.67,0:08:48.84,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,But you and I are\Ndestined to fight.
Dialogue: 50,0:08:48.84,0:08:51.13,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I don't need vengeance\Nas an excuse.
Dialogue: 50,0:08:51.13,0:08:53.42,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Wouldn't you agree, Raizo?
Dialogue: 50,0:08:53.42,0:08:54.64,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Indeed!
Dialogue: 50,0:10:33.88,0:10:34.07,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's done.
Dialogue: 50,0:10:34.07,0:10:34.96,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's done.
Dialogue: 50,0:10:34.96,0:10:35.15,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,My turn! Now, Room!
Dialogue: 50,0:10:35.15,0:10:37.38,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}My turn. Now, Room!
Dialogue: 50,0:10:37.38,0:10:37.40,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Shambles!
Dialogue: 50,0:10:37.40,0:10:38.88,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Shambles!
Dialogue: 50,0:10:38.88,0:10:42.76,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Huh? Where am I? It's dark!
Dialogue: 50,0:10:42.76,0:10:44.34,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Damn it, Zeus!
Dialogue: 50,0:10:44.34,0:10:44.45,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Can you do it, Roronoa?
Dialogue: 50,0:10:44.45,0:10:46.54,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Can you do it, Roronoa?
Dialogue: 50,0:10:46.54,0:10:46.64,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Do I have a choice?
Dialogue: 50,0:10:46.64,0:10:48.31,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Do I have a choice?
Dialogue: 50,0:10:54.40,0:10:54.42,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I won't let you go back to her!
Dialogue: 50,0:10:54.42,0:10:57.05,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I won't let you go back to her!
Dialogue: 50,0:10:57.05,0:11:00.76,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Flame-Rend...\NCrossing the Six Paths!
Dialogue: 50,0:11:02.64,0:11:04.01,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,No, no, no!\NStop the violence!
Dialogue: 50,0:11:04.01,0:11:06.10,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm just an innocent sword!
Dialogue: 50,0:11:06.10,0:11:08.94,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\q2}– Mama! Help me, please!\N– Mama! Help me, please!
Dialogue: 50,0:11:08.94,0:11:10.19,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm coming!
Dialogue: 50,0:11:14.96,0:11:15.06,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Pathetic!
Dialogue: 50,0:11:15.06,0:11:16.69,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Pathetic!
Dialogue: 50,0:11:16.69,0:11:16.75,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You thought you could win if you\Ntook my homies away, huh?
Dialogue: 50,0:11:16.75,0:11:20.01,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You thought you could win if\Nyou took my homies away, huh?
Dialogue: 50,0:11:20.01,0:11:20.11,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'll crush you!
Dialogue: 50,0:11:20.11,0:11:22.13,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'll crush you!
Dialogue: 50,0:11:26.28,0:11:26.39,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Don't push it, hag!
Dialogue: 50,0:11:26.39,0:11:28.72,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Don't push it, hag!
Dialogue: 50,0:11:30.06,0:11:30.29,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Repel!
Dialogue: 50,0:11:30.29,0:11:31.62,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Repel!
Dialogue: 50,0:11:33.67,0:11:35.08,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}And Takt!
Dialogue: 50,0:11:37.88,0:11:37.98,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You idiot!
Dialogue: 50,0:11:37.98,0:11:39.26,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You idiot!
Dialogue: 50,0:11:39.26,0:11:39.36,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You think you'll beat me\Nby hitting me with a rock?
Dialogue: 50,0:11:39.36,0:11:42.03,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You think you'll beat me\Nby hitting me with a rock?
Dialogue: 50,0:11:48.74,0:11:51.23,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Huh? Uh-oh!
Dialogue: 50,0:11:57.00,0:11:58.50,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Mama!
Dialogue: 50,0:11:58.50,0:11:58.69,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,If there's no one to catch her,\Nthen that's one down!
Dialogue: 50,0:11:58.69,0:12:01.90,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,If there's no one to catch\Nher, then that's one down!
Dialogue: 50,0:12:03.78,0:12:05.41,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,How was that?
Dialogue: 50,0:12:49.20,0:12:50.62,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,How is he standing?
Dialogue: 50,0:12:50.62,0:12:53.33,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That attack probably broke\Nhalf of his bones.
Dialogue: 50,0:12:53.33,0:12:55.16,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What is he made of?
Dialogue: 50,0:12:56.11,0:12:59.66,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Pathetic, Linlin.\NYou got sloppy.
Dialogue: 50,0:13:00.51,0:13:03.34,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Guess I gotta do this\Njob on my own.
Dialogue: 50,0:13:05.89,0:13:07.81,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey, Pirate Hunter!
Dialogue: 50,0:13:08.65,0:13:11.61,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Let him go! I'm warning you!
Dialogue: 50,0:13:13.78,0:13:15.40,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Time for Shambles!
Dialogue: 50,0:13:19.24,0:13:21.20,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Injection Shot!
Dialogue: 50,0:13:24.96,0:13:29.50,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I don't know what you did,\Nbut I don't like it one bit!
Dialogue: 50,0:13:29.50,0:13:30.59,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Now die!
Dialogue: 50,0:13:37.59,0:13:39.13,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Mama!
Dialogue: 50,0:13:39.13,0:13:42.09,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Agh! Go away!
Dialogue: 50,0:13:42.09,0:13:47.76,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hold on! I'm coming! Mama!
Dialogue: 50,0:13:55.69,0:13:57.86,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Pull it together, Traffy!
Dialogue: 50,0:13:57.86,0:14:00.74,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That fire thing,\Nit's gonna save Big Mom
Dialogue: 50,0:14:00.74,0:14:02.49,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,if we don't do something quick!
Dialogue: 50,0:14:05.22,0:14:07.43,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I-It doesn't matter. Let it go.
Dialogue: 50,0:14:09.37,0:14:11.66,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I don't want one of us to die.
Dialogue: 50,0:14:13.12,0:14:15.29,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'd rather have\Nthe mission fail.
Dialogue: 50,0:14:22.26,0:14:23.97,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You don't have to worry;
Dialogue: 50,0:14:23.97,0:14:27.30,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,all we had to do was tear\NBig Mom and Kaido apart.
Dialogue: 50,0:14:28.35,0:14:32.06,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We've come far enough, no need\Nto throw your lives away.
Dialogue: 50,0:14:48.04,0:14:50.46,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That sure was a close\None, wasn't it?
Dialogue: 50,0:14:54.24,0:14:57.42,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oh, my sweet,\Nadorable Prometheus!
Dialogue: 50,0:14:57.42,0:14:59.25,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Thank you so much!
Dialogue: 50,0:15:01.40,0:15:03.82,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,But somebody didn't bother!
Dialogue: 50,0:15:03.82,0:15:05.86,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Zeus! Where the hell are you?
Dialogue: 50,0:15:06.82,0:15:08.57,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That useless idiot!
Dialogue: 50,0:15:11.36,0:15:12.82,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What a pity.
Dialogue: 50,0:15:13.16,0:15:15.70,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,He really let you\Ndown, didn't he?
Dialogue: 50,0:15:16.04,0:15:18.58,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You can't rely on that lazy\Nchump to do anything,
Dialogue: 50,0:15:18.58,0:15:20.12,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,if you ask me!
Dialogue: 50,0:15:22.89,0:15:27.02,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I don't suppose I\Ncould ask for a favor, could I?
Dialogue: 50,0:15:27.02,0:15:29.11,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hm? What is it?
Dialogue: 50,0:15:49.71,0:15:53.37,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That's funny! Can you\Nbelieve that face?
Dialogue: 50,0:15:53.37,0:15:57.56,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That cold stare,\Njust like last time!
Dialogue: 50,0:15:57.56,0:16:01.36,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Even though he's unconscious,\Nthe boy's still glaring at me.
Dialogue: 50,0:16:01.36,0:16:05.03,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You got something you\Nwanna say, you little punk?
Dialogue: 50,0:16:07.80,0:16:10.01,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,If you don't get up soon,
Dialogue: 50,0:16:10.01,0:16:13.30,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna smash those\Neyeballs right in.
Dialogue: 50,0:16:13.89,0:16:16.35,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,And then the rest of your skull.
Dialogue: 50,0:16:16.35,0:16:20.77,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,And your face.\NAnd your heart, too!
Dialogue: 50,0:16:21.29,0:16:22.06,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey,
Dialogue: 50,0:16:24.79,0:16:26.84,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I got one good move left in me.
Dialogue: 50,0:16:27.38,0:16:29.67,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,And it's gonna push\Nme to the limit.
Dialogue: 50,0:16:30.44,0:16:31.78,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You're kidding me.
Dialogue: 50,0:16:31.78,0:16:34.57,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Anything less than my\Nbest wouldn't be enough.
Dialogue: 50,0:16:34.90,0:16:36.66,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It would just wear me down.
Dialogue: 50,0:16:38.47,0:16:40.80,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Either this attack\Nworks, or I die.
Dialogue: 50,0:16:41.18,0:16:42.12,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Maybe it's my time to go.
Dialogue: 50,0:16:42.12,0:16:46.42,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,If this is it for me...\Ngood luck.
Dialogue: 50,0:16:59.55,0:17:01.34,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey, Kaido!
Dialogue: 50,0:17:05.68,0:17:08.52,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I got a duty\Nto protect my captain!
Dialogue: 50,0:17:11.18,0:17:14.23,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You wanna smash\Na head in that bad?
Dialogue: 50,0:17:14.23,0:17:17.32,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Try mine first,\Nif you think you can!
Dialogue: 50,0:18:58.52,0:19:02.78,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,So you have it as well...\NThat was Conqueror's Haki.
Dialogue: 50,0:19:02.78,0:19:04.91,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Tch. Oh, yeah?
Dialogue: 50,0:19:04.91,0:19:06.95,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Y'think that means\Nsomething to me?
Dialogue: 50,0:19:09.09,0:19:11.92,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Whatever you call it,\Nit still wasn't enough.
Dialogue: 50,0:19:13.94,0:19:14.34,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That was all my strength\Nand you barely even flinched.
Dialogue: 50,0:19:14.34,0:19:18.39,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That was all my strength,\Nand you barely even flinched.
Dialogue: 50,0:19:22.11,0:19:26.07,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I was hoping... you'd\Nfall to your knees... at least.
Dialogue: 50,0:19:26.07,0:19:28.07,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Well, you should be proud, kid.
Dialogue: 50,0:19:29.24,0:19:29.48,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You've given me a scar\Nthat will never fade.
Dialogue: 50,0:19:29.48,0:19:31.89,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Give me a scar that\Nwill never fade,
Dialogue: 50,0:19:40.35,0:19:43.48,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Your generation has\Ncertainly earned its name.
Dialogue: 50,0:19:49.99,0:19:52.57,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Zoro, run! Hurry!
Dialogue: 50,0:19:57.45,0:19:59.66,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You stay right there.
Dialogue: 50,0:19:59.66,0:20:02.83,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Save yourself the trouble,\NI'll come to you.
Dialogue: 50,0:20:30.60,0:20:32.56,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's a damn shame.
Dialogue: 50,0:20:32.56,0:20:36.74,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,If you joined me, we could've\Nconquered the world together.
Dialogue: 50,0:20:36.74,0:20:38.25,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,If we joined you?
Dialogue: 50,0:20:38.25,0:20:38.30,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Why the hell would\Nwe ever join you?
Dialogue: 50,0:20:38.30,0:20:38.74,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Why the hell would\Nwe ever join you?
Dialogue: 50,0:20:38.74,0:20:41.62,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Why the hell would\Nwe ever join you?
Dialogue: 50,0:20:44.87,0:20:48.25,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We'll do anything\Nto help the samurai.
Dialogue: 50,0:20:52.79,0:20:55.89,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'll kick your ass,\Nno matter what!
Dialogue: 50,0:20:55.89,0:20:57.85,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You wanna repeat that?
Dialogue: 50,0:20:59.09,0:20:59.09,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You'll kick my ass?
Dialogue: 50,0:20:59.09,0:21:01.93,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You'll kick my ass?
Dialogue: 50,0:21:10.10,0:21:10.56,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Fine. Try it, then.
Dialogue: 50,0:21:10.56,0:21:13.56,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,All right, go ahead\Nand try it, then.
Dialogue: 50,0:21:13.56,0:21:17.15,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You're not the type to think\Nbefore you punch, are you?
Dialogue: 50,0:21:17.15,0:21:20.65,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,If you got something\Nleft, show me!
Dialogue: 50,0:21:25.79,0:21:27.79,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,You need to pull back!
Dialogue: 50,0:21:27.79,0:21:29.12,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,It's quite simple.
Dialogue: 50,0:21:29.12,0:21:30.16,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,"Haki," as you call it,\Ncoats your entire body.
Dialogue: 50,0:21:30.16,0:21:32.00,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,coats your outside
Dialogue: 50,0:21:32.00,0:21:32.13,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,It can be used as armor,\Nand also as a weapon
Dialogue: 50,0:21:32.13,0:21:35.50,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,It can be used as invisible\Narmor or as a weapon.
Dialogue: 50,0:21:35.55,0:21:36.50,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,And then, when you push\Nbeyond its limits,
Dialogue: 50,0:21:36.50,0:21:38.12,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,268)}However, when you push\Nthat power beyond its limits
Dialogue: 50,0:21:38.12,0:21:38.59,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,your Haki doesn't simply\Nfortify your strength
Dialogue: 50,0:21:38.59,0:21:41.34,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,your Haki doesn't simply\Nfortify your strength,
Dialogue: 50,0:21:41.34,0:21:45.97,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,it penetrates the enemy's body\Nand destroys it from within.
Dialogue: 50,0:21:48.69,0:21:48.94,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,Don't overstress yourself!
Dialogue: 50,0:21:48.94,0:21:50.90,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,Don't overstress yourself!
Dialogue: 50,0:21:50.90,0:21:52.44,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,Let the Haki flow to your fist
Dialogue: 50,0:21:52.44,0:21:52.69,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,from the parts that\Naren't using it!
Dialogue: 50,0:21:52.69,0:21:55.44,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,from the parts that\Naren't using it!
Dialogue: 50,0:21:57.40,0:21:59.95,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}...Kong Gun!
Dialogue: 50,0:22:05.74,0:22:07.98,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The last time,\Nit was too shallow.
Dialogue: 50,0:22:07.98,0:22:08.63,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,In the midst of danger\Nis when true power blooms!
Dialogue: 50,0:22:08.63,0:22:11.67,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,The midst of danger is\Nwhen true power blooms
Dialogue: 50,0:22:15.50,0:22:16.67,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,But I figured it out
Dialogue: 50,0:22:16.67,0:22:18.88,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,when you attacked\Nwith your club.
Dialogue: 50,0:22:21.20,0:22:24.75,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You can infuse things\Nwith Conqueror's Haki.
Dialogue: 50,0:22:29.96,0:22:32.84,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,How exactly will\Nknowing that help you?
Dialogue: 50,0:22:32.84,0:22:35.60,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You think you can do it, too?
Dialogue: 50,0:22:46.69,0:22:49.52,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,This is the privilege\Nof the strong!
Dialogue: 50,0:22:49.52,0:22:53.07,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,A dead man walking like\Nyou couldn't dream of it!
Dialogue: 50,0:22:53.07,0:22:54.78,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'll show you!
Dialogue: 50,0:23:04.70,0:23:06.12,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What the hell?
Dialogue: 50,0:23:54.38,0:23:54.42,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Don't overstress yourself!
Dialogue: 50,0:23:54.42,0:23:56.33,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,Don't overstress yourself!
Dialogue: 50,0:23:58.13,0:23:58.17,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,from the parts that\Naren't using it!
Dialogue: 50,0:23:58.17,0:24:00.92,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,from the parts that\Naren't using it!
Dialogue: 50,0:25:37.63,0:25:41.30,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Thanks for protecting me,\Nbut I'm good now.
Dialogue: 50,0:25:42.84,0:25:42.87,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You two should head downstairs!
Dialogue: 50,0:25:42.87,0:25:45.18,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You two should\Nhead downstairs.
Dialogue: 50,0:25:45.18,0:25:45.33,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I know I can do it.\NI won't lose this time.
Dialogue: 50,0:25:45.33,0:25:49.25,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I know I can do it.\NI won't lose this time.
Dialogue: 50,0:25:55.69,0:25:55.72,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Tell everyone else:\NWe're gonna win.
Dialogue: 50,0:25:55.72,0:25:59.97,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Tell everyone else:\NWe're gonna win.
